DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45563::$$$message_0431_0000_0000$$$::"We've made it this far... Are you okay, Sakura?"::
45564::$$$message_0431_0000_0001$$$::"...Yeah. But you look more tired than me, Uncle."::
45566::$$$message_0431_0000_0003$$$::"Hahaha. I'm doing fine. The bugs are just going a little wild and tearing up my blood vessels and organs."::
45567::$$$message_0431_0000_0004$$$::"That's right. You lose this much blood every day. You'll live, Kariya."::
45568::$$$message_0431_0000_0005$$$::"I wish [font italic=true]you'd[font italic=false] be more considerate, though! When you act thoughtlessly like that, my blood starts to boil, you know!"::
45569::$$$message_0431_0000_0006$$$::"I'm terribly sorry. I'm trying to manage my pacing, but Kariya's mana supply is utterly pitiful; it falls short of my expectations."::
45570::$$$message_0431_0000_0007$$$::"That's not even an apology![wvl canskip=false time=100][hffgchg2 chara=雁夜 face=吐血 pos=left time=300 twno=1][se storage=se05053.wav][hfangry layer=0] Agh, urk, I get dizzy when I shout... Th-the wind hurts... The sunlight burns..."::
45571::$$$message_0431_0000_0008$$$::"..."::
45572::$$$message_0431_0000_0009$$$::"Hey, Saber, don't those people seem a little strange? Are they zombies? They kinda look like zombies."::
45573::$$$message_0431_0000_0010$$$::"Now that you mention it, they are utterly bizarre. That hooded man...is he a Master? And the man in a suit next to him is...[wvl canskip=false time=400][playstop time=3000 storage=bgm07.ogg][hffgchg2 chara=セイバー4th face=呆れ pos=right time=300 twno=1] Wait...that's..."::
45574::$$$message_0431_0000_0011$$$::"...![wm canskip=0][wvl canskip=false time=400][hfangry layer=0][se storage=se05013.wav] K-K-Kariya, let us move on! This position is tactically unsound!"::
45575::$$$message_0431_0000_0012$$$::"Sorry, Berserker. I need a time out. I think I'll barf if I move..."::
45576::$$$message_0431_0000_0013$$$::"Stay where you are. I can see that you are a Master seeking the onsen. Let us face one another."::
45577::$$$message_0431_0000_0014$$$::"By the way, you with the long hair. Have we met somewhere?"::
45578::$$$message_0431_0000_0015$$$::"..."::
45579::$$$message_0431_0000_0016$$$::"I said, have we met?"::
45580::$$$message_0431_0000_0017$$$::"N-no, I just have one of those faces. I am a Fuyuki native. My name is Ransurouto."::
45581::$$$message_0431_0000_0018$$$::"Oh? So you were born and raised in Japan?"::
45583::$$$message_0431_0000_0020$$$::"Indeed, and I've never met a woman as beautiful as you. I had a rough upbringing, you see."::
45584::$$$message_0431_0000_0021$$$::"By the way, what's your favorite lake? Lake Suwa? Lake Chuuzenji? Or perhaps... Nimue?"::
45585::$$$message_0431_0000_0022$$$::"I-I've never heard of such a lake fairy. Almost all lakes are cursed places, after all."::
45586::$$$message_0431_0000_0023$$$::"Why are you avoiding eye contact?"::
45587::$$$message_0431_0000_0024$$$::"I, uh, I'm shy around new people. Eye contact makes me uncomfortable."::
45588::$$$message_0431_0000_0025$$$::"What is your opinion on cuckoldry?"::
45589::$$$message_0431_0000_0026$$$::"Well, um..."::
45590::$$$message_0431_0000_0027$$$::"Do you think that stalking is appropriate behavior for a knight?"::
45591::$$$message_0431_0000_0028$$$::"No, er..."::
45592::$$$message_0431_0000_0029$$$::"Remind me what your name was again, Mister Whatsalot?"::
45593::$$$message_0431_0000_0030$$$::"Eeeep! H-help, Kariya! My king is terrifying!"::
45594::$$$message_0431_0000_0031$$$::"It's unusual to see Saber acting this cold-blooded... She must be [font italic=true]really[font italic=false] upset with him."::
45595::$$$message_0431_0000_0032$$$::"..."::
45596::$$$message_0431_0000_0033$$$::"Oh, dear. I should stay on my guard, too. Are you Berserker's Master? We haven't met before, but I'm pretty good at hanafuda...[wvl canskip=false time=300][hffgchg2 chara=アイリ face=驚き pos=right time=300 twno=1] What's wrong?"::
45597::$$$message_0431_0000_0034$$$::(That's nice... Her long hair, graceful demeanor, bountiful bosoms, and sweet voice... She's like a European Aoi, no, an Aoi from another dimension!)::
45598::$$$message_0431_0000_0035$$$::(Could this be a fateful encounter...!? Maybe the Grail is telling me to give up on Aoi and start over with someone new!)::
45599::$$$message_0431_0000_0036$$$::"..."::
45600::$$$message_0431_0000_0037$$$::"Yeowch! W-what are you doing, Sakura!? Don't use bug spray around me! I'll die!"::
45602::$$$message_0431_0000_0039$$$::"Calm down, Uncle. ...She's your enemy. I think she's the kind of person you hate most: a normie living a fulfilled life."::
45603::$$$message_0431_0000_0040$$$::"W-what!? She's a married woman!? Even better!"::
45604::$$$message_0431_0000_0041$$$::"...DIE."::
45605::$$$message_0431_0000_0042$$$::"Jet!?"::
45606::$$$message_0431_0000_0043$$$::"What is the matter with this sad Master-Servant team... The only one with any sense seems to be that girl..."::
45607::$$$message_0431_0000_0044$$$::"Hello, Kiritsugu? We just ran into Berserker's Master. What should we do?"::
45608::$$$message_0431_0000_0045$$$::"I have eyes on them, Iri. I know what's happening."::
45609::$$$message_0431_0000_0046$$$::"I guess Saber [font italic=true]can[font italic=false] be ruthless when she feels like it... Going after his weaknesses with no mercy... I like it."::
45610::$$$message_0431_0000_0047$$$::"Maybe I'll adjust my opinion of her a little...[wvl][hfwww layer=0] If only she could be this much of a warmonger all the time, we could trade dark battlefield jokes and make Lancer suffer..."::
45611::$$$message_0431_0000_0048$$$::"Kiritsugu? Are you still with me? Earth to Kiritsugu..."::
45613::$$$message_0431_0000_0050$$$::"Whoops. Sorry, Iri.[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=切嗣 face=喜 pos=left time=300 twno=1] Leave Kariya Matou be. He'll go challenge Tokiomi Tohsaka and self-destruct if we leave him alone."::
45614::$$$message_0431_0000_0051$$$::"All right. Then, I'll call Saber back...[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=アイリ face=驚き pos=right time=300 twno=1] Oh? Something's coming out of the hooded man's body..."::
45615::$$$message_0431_0000_0052$$$::"Are those...insects? Such unusual familiars. He's turned his body into a nest of hornets."::
45616::$$$message_0431_0000_0053$$$::"...Wait. Hornets. Hornet familiars! That means..."::
45617::$$$message_0431_0000_0054$$$::"Oh... Ohh... Ohhhhh! Maiya, the Stinger! Bring me the Stinger!"::
45618::$$$message_0431_0000_0055$$$::"Huh, we don't have it? It's not in the trunk? Then I'll use my rifle![wvl][se storage=SE_0011.wav] Die, you bee bastard!"::
45619::$$$message_0431_0000_0056$$$::"Whoa! Is someone shooting at me!?[wm canskip=0][wvl canskip=false time=400][hffgchg2 chara=雁夜 face=真剣2 pos=center time=500 twno=1][hfsweat layer=2 ox=-90 oy=0][hfangry layer=2] Damn it, way to spoil our meeting! Looks like I've got no choice!"::
45620::$$$message_0431_0000_0057$$$::"Go, Berserker! It's time to play hanafuda!"::
�